  "notes": {
    "n1": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 1000,
      "text": "Assumptions to confirm in code\n\n1. Hero ตั้งเตือน sends menu_reminders today; Proposed reminder_new opens the keyboard pre-filled (check LINE client support for inputOption/fillInText).\n2. Monthly reminders on 29–31 and yearly 29 Feb: current cron behaviour in short months is undocumented, so screens warn instead of guessing.\n3. “เพิ่งเตือน” shows only the last 24 h (firedAt purge). Full history is Proposed.\n4. Countdown = whole Bangkok calendar days; deadline_note is never parsed into a time.\n5. Open deadlines count includes the undated item (4 open · 1 applied · 1 closed).\n6. AI reset = next midnight America/Los_Angeles: 14:00 now, 15:00 from 1 Nov 2026.\n7. Calendar events are read-only in the planner; adding one stays a separate chat action.\n8. Group files g1/g2, reminders r4/r5 and poster f4 are extra fictional fixtures.\n9. One deliberate light paper theme. A dark variant is an open question, not designed here.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 0
    },
    "np": {
      "fill": "green",
      "maxH": 844,
      "text": "Connected flows in one phone (390×844, pinned tab bar, content scrolls):\n\n• First open: language choice, remembered after reload; switch again in ของฉัน › ภาษา / Language. Every label, date and message changes language.\n• วันนี้: week strip, prev/next, กลับวันนี้, month overlay (Escape closes), date-aware empty states, เก็บไว้ panel.\n• เตือนทั้งหมด: categories, change time, cancel with confirm, fired → done / snooze.\n• ตั้งเตือน: chat examples (one asks “2 โมง” = 08:00 or 14:00), validation, repeat options revealed on ทำซ้ำ, save → confirmation. Leaving with unsaved input asks first.\n• Deadline: filters → detail → สมัครแล้ว หยุดเตือน / เตือนต่อ, delete → เอาคืน, split a merged item, alert settings (Save only when changed).\n• คลัง: mine / group, tabs, list / gallery, search with ‘กำลังหาให้…’, file detail, forget a fact.\n• ของฉัน › ต้นแบบ: จำลอง: network normal / slow 3 s / very slow 12 s (long-wait after 8 s) / fails; AI at limit; Drive disconnect → reconnect.\n• Loading shows skeleton + status text at once, mini JaiJa after 400 ms; OS reduced-motion uses static poses.",
      "w": 520,
      "x": 470,
      "y": -1250
    },
